description: Trigger ONLY when the user asks to generate or collect an XDR endpoint
  (agent) support file or diagnostic bundle for one or more endpoints, typically for
  troubleshooting endpoint issues. Covers generating the support file on resolved
  endpoints with mandatory endpoint_id resolution. Do not use for endpoint upgrade,
  script execution, isolation, file/process response, or exception-rule review.
